<title>UK: HORSE RACING-NOW DETTORI TURNS TV POP PRESENTER.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-NOW DETTORI TURNS TV POP PRESENTER.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jockey Frankie Dettori, who rode into the record books with seven wins from seven rides in one day at Ascot during September, is going pop.</p>
<p>On Friday, Dettori will present television's &quot;Top Of The Pops,&quot; which features the latest hit tunes.  He said: &quot;I'm feeling a bit nervous. It's not going to be as easy as riding a horse!&quot;</p>
</text>
